                        "prompt": "Before you roll: cut through what it resists, or find the gap in its guard?",
                        "type": "choice"
                    },
                    "event": "action-used",
                    "note": "“Before rolling, choose” — so the choice is offered on the cast, and both answers are worn until the Strike resolves. The Technique shipped with `rules: []` and no riders at all: none of its three promises happened (#80).",
                    "self": true
