        "defense": null,
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Your spirit weapon is Released · <strong>Cost</strong> 1 Reiatsu Point</p><hr /><p>Make one Strike. <strong>Before rolling</strong>, choose:</p><ul><li>it <strong>ignores all resistances and immunities</strong> to its damage type, <em>or</em></li><li>it treats the target's <strong>AC as 2 lower</strong>.</li></ul><p>On a hit, it deals an additional @Damage[5d6[untyped]] damage.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> +1d6.</p><hr /><p><em>The AC clause is capped at &minus;2 so it cannot combine with flanking and a status penalty to erase a boss's defence. The choice is made before the roll, so it is a stance you enter for one Strike rather than a result you pick afterwards &mdash; the two modes below are that choice.</em></p>"
